Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: gnomato
Architecture: all
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 50)
Description: Pomodoro timer for the GNOME Shell panel
 Gnomato keeps one interval at a time in the panel: a pomodoro, a short
 break or a long break, with the length of each configurable and the
 countdown visible at a glance.
 .
 Finished, skipped and interrupted intervals are appended to a journal in
 XDG_STATE_HOME, so the day's progress survives a shell restart or a
 screen lock.
